			},
			"date": "2023-02-13T22:44:45.000Z",
			"content": "<p><span class=\"h-card\"><a href=\"https://fediverse.zachleat.com/@zachleat\" class=\"u-url mention\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\" target=\"_blank\">@<span>zachleat</span></a></span> what are the expectations of the role? </p><p>Does the organization doing the hiring expect you to be productive immediately or in several weeks? </p><p>Are you a contractor being hired for a specific duration?</p><p>Should you be expected to know where the foot guns are in the framework the team is using?</p><p>What level of experience?</p><p>This kinda feels like “do I want someone who speaks Latin right now or someone who knows proto-Indo-European who can learn Latin”.</p>",
			"via": "fediverse"
		},
