			"date": "2023-02-13T22:50:14.324Z",
			"content": "<p><span class=\"h-card\" translate=\"no\"><a href=\"https://mastodon.cthos.dev/@cthos\" class=\"u-url mention\">@<span>cthos</span></a></span> haha, this is my point—kinda.</p><p>A: “It&#39;s more important that you have a solid foundation as a web developer than knowing about every framework”</p><p>B: “Lit—we use Lit—you should know Lit”</p>",
