			},
			"date": "2023-02-13T23:05:51.864Z",
			"content": "<p><span class=\"h-card\" translate=\"no\"><a href=\"https://mastodon.cthos.dev/@cthos\" class=\"u-url mention\">@<span>cthos</span></a></span> I think we might have gotten off track—might be useful to circle back to the original point: Are you saying that you would prefer B in some cases?</p>",
